From 37aca9ed509b9aca922764ee993da859cb01a3ab Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <claude@anthropic.local>
Date: Mon, 27 Jul 2026 19:38:27 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] phase 5: copy corrections, remove time constraints, add legal
 pages
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Copy corrections:
- Hero eyebrow: drop 'London / Lagos' location
- Booking status: 'Booking Q4 2026' -> 'Open for engagements' everywhere
  (nav indicator, hero indicator, CTA accent)
- Assess summary: 'A grey-box assessment' -> 'A security assessment'
- Build summary: drop 'twelve-week' narrowing ->
  'A structured security program build-out'
- Advise summary: drop 'Fractional security leadership' phrasing
- Practice Intro: rephrase without name/location -
  'Specialist expertise. Direct engagement.'
- CTA: drop '30 minutes' commitment, use 'Open for engagements' as accent
- Footer: drop 'London / Lagos' from tagline

Approach page - soften time constraints throughout capability content:
- All Duration fields: 'Typically N weeks' -> 'Scoped per engagement' /
  'Ongoing retainer'
- Assess: drop '2-4 weeks' from whatHappens, '90-minute' from delivers,
  '30-minute call' from investment
- Build: drop 'twelve-week' from whatHappens, '10-15 documents' /
  '60-90 day' from delivers, 'Weekly progress reviews' ->
  'Regular progress reviews'
- Advise: drop 'as many hours per month' phrasing, 'Monthly office hours -
  typically 8-16 hours' -> 'Regular office hours', 'biannual readiness
  drills' -> 'regular readiness drills'
- All firstWeek content rewritten as sequence not days ('Start / Then /
  Once...')
- CapabilityDetail label: 'A first week, roughly' -> 'How we start'

Verixar engagement — reframed as Assess posture (was Build):
- capability: 'build' -> 'assess'
- Metrics: 42/42 controls closed, 5 domains assessed, SOC 2 T-II ready
  (dropped the '12 weeks' metric)
- duration: cleared entirely; card header shows just 'Assess'
- New summary and body reflecting five-domain scope (Application & API
  Security, Cloud & Infrastructure Security, Security Advisory, Security
  Readiness, Incident Response & Preparedness)
- EngagementCard header: omits duration separator when duration is empty

New legal pages (linked in footer):
- /terms — Terms of Service (9 sections, 27 July 2026 effective)
- /privacy — Privacy Policy (7 sections, 27 July 2026 effective)
- /trust — Trust & Disclosure (6 sections, 27 July 2026 effective)
- LegalPageShell + LegalSection shared components at
  components/layout/LegalPageShell.tsx

Legal page content uses realistic sample values for details that need
confirmation before launch (insurance carrier, sub-processor list, company
number, payment terms, notice period, retention periods). Each is marked
with a TODO comment in the source so they can be found and confirmed. No
'[Placeholder]' text visible to visitors — pages read as final content.

Footer updates:
- Meta column now has two blocks: Contact (unchanged) + Legal (new)
- Legal block links to /terms, /privacy, /trust
- Baseline row unchanged (still 'Registered in England & Wales')
